    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1security_1_1_t_s_a_event_hooks" kindref="compound">TSAEventHooks</ref> — optional callbacks fired by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_t_s_a_client_wrapper" kindref="compound">TSAClientWrapper</ref>.</para>
<para>All callbacks are invoked synchronously on the calling thread. Leave any field as nullptr to suppress that callback.</para>
<para>Typical use: wire these to the audit-log subsystem or Prometheus counters without creating a compile-time dependency between the TSA module and those subsystems. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
